{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>內地北方多地的中小學開始放雪假，多地雪場亦開放，黑龍江哈爾濱的「網紅大雪人」即將堆砌。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.SNOW-2000.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026EYfLTvvJow1795781154.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>坐落哈爾濱松花江畔的大雪人，是當地知名冰雪裝置，據介紹今年大雪人整體高度將達19.5米，創下新高，大雪人亦將延續紅帽、紅圍巾、紅心裝飾的經典造型。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-27-20h07m28s879.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026PHNVtD3Oth1795781296.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>哈爾濱又聯同齊齊哈爾市，打造「冰雪雙城記」吸引遊客，遊客只要乘搭高鐵，最快一個半小時，就可以從「冰城」哈爾濱，到「鶴城」齊齊哈爾，體驗兩地的冬日氛圍。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-27-20h07m37s528.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RxslCC2IZP1795781361.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-27-20h07m59s623.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zSMOFC1d3i1795781371.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-27-20h07m52s013.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026d57rMismnH1795781332.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>而位於最北面的城市黑龍江漠河，近日亦迎來不少家庭團組，有遊客體驗「潑水成冰」，也有遊客坐雪圈、打雪仗，享受冰雪運動樂趣。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.SNOW-2000-1_CLEAN_20261127_203111_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Fu3uLaFOTp1795783719.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-27-20h09m54s210.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gc5nitc0k01795781406.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-27-20h10m24s384.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026M5EwWWXb6t1795781459.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>隨著雪季到來，新疆、吉林、河北、內蒙等多地城市的中小學，陸續開始放雪假，各地亦推出免費滑雪活動，吸引學生。</p><p></p><p>四川遊客吳敏說：「我們是四川過來的，因為我們那邊沒有雪嘛，很少有看見雪，覺得哈爾濱的雪和冬天很美。」</p><p></p><p>有旅遊業界人士預計，雪假將帶動2026至2027雪季冰雪遊，親子家庭客所佔比例，將升至四成半。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T13:03:55.026310+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":407,"images":8,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T11:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T03:37:24.253726+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T12:57:17.513884+00:00","content_hash":"44586a23c71bab5a0dfb6468a9835834e24a0ec805732a8fc6f811e4174c43ab","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T13:03:55.026310+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}